{
  "book": "2nephi",
  "bookName": "2 Nephi",
  "chapter": 23,
  "voice": {
    "provider": "elevenlabs",
    "voice_id": "ddDFRErfhdc2asyySOG5",
    "model_id": "eleven_multilingual_v2",
    "settings": {
      "stability": 0.5,
      "similarity_boost": 0.75,
      "style": 0.35,
      "use_speaker_boost": true
    },
    "name": "Samuel"
  },
  "pauses": {
    "line_ms": 180,
    "verse_ms": 500
  },
  "duration": 220.344,
  "lines": [
    {
      "start": 0.0,
      "end": 3.622,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "The burden of Babylon, which Isaiah the son of Amoz did see.",
      "verse": "23:1",
      "lineIndex": 1
    },
    {
      "start": 4.302,
      "end": 6.949,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "Lift ye up a banner upon the high mountain,",
      "verse": "23:2",
      "lineIndex": 2
    },
    {
      "start": 7.129,
      "end": 9.172,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "exalt the voice unto them,",
      "verse": "23:2",
      "lineIndex": 3
    },
    {
      "start": 9.352,
      "end": 10.652,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "shake the hand,",
      "verse": "23:2",
      "lineIndex": 4
    },
    {
      "start": 10.832,
      "end": 13.665,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "that they may go into the gates of the nobles.",
      "verse": "23:2",
      "lineIndex": 5
    },
    {
      "start": 14.345,
      "end": 16.713,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "I have commanded my sanctified ones,",
      "verse": "23:3",
      "lineIndex": 6
    },
    {
      "start": 16.893,
      "end": 18.936,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "I have also called my mighty ones,",
      "verse": "23:3",
      "lineIndex": 7
    },
    {
      "start": 19.116,
      "end": 22.924,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "for mine anger is not upon them that rejoice in my highness.",
      "verse": "23:3",
      "lineIndex": 8
    },
    {
      "start": 23.604,
      "end": 26.205,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "The noise of the multitude in the mountains",
      "verse": "23:4",
      "lineIndex": 9
    },
    {
      "start": 26.385,
      "end": 28.382,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "like as of a great people,",
      "verse": "23:4",
      "lineIndex": 10
    },
    {
      "start": 28.562,
      "end": 32.37,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "a tumultuous noise of the kingdoms of nations gathered together,",
      "verse": "23:4",
      "lineIndex": 11
    },
    {
      "start": 32.55,
      "end": 35.476,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "the Lord of Hosts mustereth the hosts of the battle.",
      "verse": "23:4",
      "lineIndex": 12
    },
    {
      "start": 36.156,
      "end": 39.453,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "They come from a far country, from the end of heaven,",
      "verse": "23:5",
      "lineIndex": 13
    },
    {
      "start": 39.633,
      "end": 42.837,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "yea, the Lord, and the weapons of his indignation,",
      "verse": "23:5",
      "lineIndex": 14
    },
    {
      "start": 43.017,
      "end": 44.689,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "to destroy the whole land.",
      "verse": "23:5",
      "lineIndex": 15
    },
    {
      "start": 45.369,
      "end": 48.341,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "Howl ye, for the day of the Lord is at hand;",
      "verse": "23:6",
      "lineIndex": 17
    },
    {
      "start": 48.521,
      "end": 51.447,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "it shall come as a destruction from the Almighty.",
      "verse": "23:6",
      "lineIndex": 18
    },
    {
      "start": 52.127,
      "end": 54.449,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "Therefore shall all hands be faint,",
      "verse": "23:7",
      "lineIndex": 19
    },
    {
      "start": 54.629,
      "end": 56.765,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "every man's heart shall melt;",
      "verse": "23:7",
      "lineIndex": 20
    },
    {
      "start": 57.445,
      "end": 59.117,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "And they shall be afraid;",
      "verse": "23:8",
      "lineIndex": 21
    },
    {
      "start": 59.297,
      "end": 62.13,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "pangs and sorrows shall take hold of them;",
      "verse": "23:8",
      "lineIndex": 22
    },
    {
      "start": 62.31,
      "end": 64.632,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "they shall be amazed one at another;",
      "verse": "23:8",
      "lineIndex": 23
    },
    {
      "start": 64.812,
      "end": 66.948,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "their faces shall be as flames.",
      "verse": "23:8",
      "lineIndex": 24
    },
    {
      "start": 67.628,
      "end": 69.532,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "Behold, the day of the Lord cometh,",
      "verse": "23:9",
      "lineIndex": 25
    },
    {
      "start": 69.712,
      "end": 72.452,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "cruel both with wrath and fierce anger,",
      "verse": "23:9",
      "lineIndex": 26
    },
    {
      "start": 72.632,
      "end": 74.536,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "to lay the land desolate;",
      "verse": "23:9",
      "lineIndex": 27
    },
    {
      "start": 74.716,
      "end": 78.013,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "and he shall destroy the sinners thereof out of it.",
      "verse": "23:9",
      "lineIndex": 28
    },
    {
      "start": 78.693,
      "end": 83.616,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "For the stars of heaven and the constellations thereof shall not give their light;",
      "verse": "23:10",
      "lineIndex": 29
    },
    {
      "start": 83.796,
      "end": 86.815,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "the sun shall be darkened in his going forth,",
      "verse": "23:10",
      "lineIndex": 30
    },
    {
      "start": 86.995,
      "end": 89.735,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "and the moon shall not cause her light to shine.",
      "verse": "23:10",
      "lineIndex": 31
    },
    {
      "start": 90.415,
      "end": 92.644,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "And I will punish the world for evil,",
      "verse": "23:11",
      "lineIndex": 32
    },
    {
      "start": 92.824,
      "end": 95.239,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "and the wicked for their iniquity;",
      "verse": "23:11",
      "lineIndex": 33
    },
    {
      "start": 95.419,
      "end": 98.577,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "I will cause the arrogancy of the proud to cease,",
      "verse": "23:11",
      "lineIndex": 34
    },
    {
      "start": 98.757,
      "end": 102.379,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "and will lay down the haughtiness of the terrible.",
      "verse": "23:11",
      "lineIndex": 35
    },
    {
      "start": 103.059,
      "end": 106.217,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "I will make a man more precious than fine gold;",
      "verse": "23:12",
      "lineIndex": 36
    },
    {
      "start": 106.397,
      "end": 108.951,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "even a man than the golden wedge of Ophir.",
      "verse": "23:12",
      "lineIndex": 37
    },
    {
      "start": 109.631,
      "end": 112.092,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "Therefore, I will shake the heavens,",
      "verse": "23:13",
      "lineIndex": 38
    },
    {
      "start": 112.272,
      "end": 117.659,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "and the earth shall remove out of her place, in the wrath of the Lord of Hosts,",
      "verse": "23:13",
      "lineIndex": 39
    },
    {
      "start": 117.839,
      "end": 120.3,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "and in the day of his fierce anger.",
      "verse": "23:13",
      "lineIndex": 40
    },
    {
      "start": 120.98,
      "end": 123.534,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "And it shall be as the chased roe,",
      "verse": "23:14",
      "lineIndex": 42
    },
    {
      "start": 123.714,
      "end": 126.268,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "and as a sheep that no man taketh up;",
      "verse": "23:14",
      "lineIndex": 43
    },
    {
      "start": 126.448,
      "end": 129.281,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "and they shall every man turn to his own people,",
      "verse": "23:14",
      "lineIndex": 44
    },
    {
      "start": 129.461,
      "end": 131.969,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "and flee every one into his own land.",
      "verse": "23:14",
      "lineIndex": 45
    },
    {
      "start": 132.649,
      "end": 135.76,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "Every one that is proud shall be thrust through;",
      "verse": "23:15",
      "lineIndex": 46
    },
    {
      "start": 135.94,
      "end": 138.726,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "yea, and every one that is joined to the wicked",
      "verse": "23:15",
      "lineIndex": 47
    },
    {
      "start": 138.906,
      "end": 140.578,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "shall fall by the sword.",
      "verse": "23:15",
      "lineIndex": 48
    },
    {
      "start": 141.258,
      "end": 145.252,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "Their children also shall be dashed to pieces before their eyes;",
      "verse": "23:16",
      "lineIndex": 49
    },
    {
      "start": 145.432,
      "end": 148.497,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "their houses shall be spoiled and their wives ravished.",
      "verse": "23:16",
      "lineIndex": 50
    },
    {
      "start": 149.177,
      "end": 152.288,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "Behold, I will stir up the Medes against them,",
      "verse": "23:17",
      "lineIndex": 51
    },
    {
      "start": 152.468,
      "end": 154.929,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "which shall not regard silver and gold,",
      "verse": "23:17",
      "lineIndex": 52
    },
    {
      "start": 155.109,
      "end": 157.059,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "nor shall they delight in it.",
      "verse": "23:17",
      "lineIndex": 53
    },
    {
      "start": 157.739,
      "end": 161.408,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "Their bows shall also dash the young men to pieces;",
      "verse": "23:18",
      "lineIndex": 54
    },
    {
      "start": 161.588,
      "end": 165.257,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "and they shall have no pity on the fruit of the womb;",
      "verse": "23:18",
      "lineIndex": 55
    },
    {
      "start": 165.437,
      "end": 167.805,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "their eyes shall not spare children.",
      "verse": "23:18",
      "lineIndex": 56
    },
    {
      "start": 168.485,
      "end": 171.086,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "And Babylon, the glory of kingdoms,",
      "verse": "23:19",
      "lineIndex": 57
    },
    {
      "start": 171.266,
      "end": 173.634,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "the beauty of the Chaldees' excellency,",
      "verse": "23:19",
      "lineIndex": 58
    },
    {
      "start": 173.814,
      "end": 177.204,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "shall be as when God overthrew Sodom and Gomorrah.",
      "verse": "23:19",
      "lineIndex": 59
    },
    {
      "start": 177.884,
      "end": 179.788,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "It shall never be inhabited,",
      "verse": "23:20",
      "lineIndex": 60
    },
    {
      "start": 179.968,
      "end": 183.544,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "neither shall it be dwelt in from generation to generation:",
      "verse": "23:20",
      "lineIndex": 61
    },
    {
      "start": 183.724,
      "end": 186.464,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "neither shall the Arabian pitch tent there;",
      "verse": "23:20",
      "lineIndex": 62
    },
    {
      "start": 186.644,
      "end": 189.384,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "neither shall the shepherds make their fold there.",
      "verse": "23:20",
      "lineIndex": 63
    },
    {
      "start": 190.064,
      "end": 192.897,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "But wild beasts of the desert shall lie there;",
      "verse": "23:21",
      "lineIndex": 64
    },
    {
      "start": 193.077,
      "end": 196.235,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "and their houses shall be full of doleful creatures;",
      "verse": "23:21",
      "lineIndex": 65
    },
    {
      "start": 196.415,
      "end": 198.319,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "and owls shall dwell there,",
      "verse": "23:21",
      "lineIndex": 66
    },
    {
      "start": 198.499,
      "end": 200.357,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "and satyrs shall dance there.",
      "verse": "23:21",
      "lineIndex": 67
    },
    {
      "start": 201.037,
      "end": 205.17,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "And the wild beasts of the islands shall cry in their desolate houses,",
      "verse": "23:22",
      "lineIndex": 68
    },
    {
      "start": 205.35,
      "end": 207.811,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "and dragons in their pleasant palaces;",
      "verse": "23:22",
      "lineIndex": 69
    },
    {
      "start": 207.991,
      "end": 209.988,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "and her time is near to come,",
      "verse": "23:22",
      "lineIndex": 70
    },
    {
      "start": 210.168,
      "end": 212.165,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "and her day shall not be prolonged.",
      "verse": "23:22",
      "lineIndex": 71
    },
    {
      "start": 212.345,
      "end": 214.388,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "For I will destroy her speedily;",
      "verse": "23:22",
      "lineIndex": 72
    },
    {
      "start": 214.568,
      "end": 217.772,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "yea, for I will be merciful unto my people,",
      "verse": "23:22",
      "lineIndex": 73
    },
    {
      "start": 217.952,
      "end": 219.67,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "but the wicked shall perish.",
      "verse": "23:22",
      "lineIndex": 74
    }
  ]
}